title: "Django for Behavioural Science"
abstract: >-
  A research-focused tutorial and example application showing how to host a jsPsych
  experiment on a bespoke Django backend and capture, manage and export the data.
  Companion to Woods (2026), Behavior Research Methods.
type: software
